Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.31,0:20:15.10,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\fad(150,0)}与追兵牵起手 Pa Pa Pa (Pa)
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.10,0:20:17.94,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5}杀手与忍者在 Dance Dance Dance (Da)
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.94,0:20:20.82,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5}好不容易闪烁光芒 想要活下去啊
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.82,0:20:23.61,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5}你果然很可爱啊 (Foo!)
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.61,0:20:26.45,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\fad(231,150)}杀手与忍者在 一 二 三 (Da)
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.45,0:20:29.20,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\fad(150,0)}牵起追兵的手 Pa Pa Pa (Pa)
Dialogue: 1,0:20:29.20,0:20:32.04,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5}闪亮☆心动 一 二 三 (Da)
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.04,0:20:34.91,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\fad(0,0)}想要舒适摇曳地活下去啊
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.92,0:20:37.88,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5}确定演出 一定满星 (喂)
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.88,0:20:40.59,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5}排名提升的话就是Happy End (喂)
